  "solution": "Given equation: (357 ÷ 2 + 3) ÷ 11 − 4 = (28 × 3 + 7) ÷ 9.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 11 and 28\n\nGiven: (357 ÷ 2 + 3) ÷ 11 − 4 = (28 × 3 + 7) ÷ 9\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (357 ÷ 2 + 3) ÷ 28 − 4 = (__**11 × 3**__ + 7) ÷ 9\n\n⇒ (__187.5____ + 3__) ÷ 28 − 4 = (__33____** + 7**__) ÷ 9\n\n⇒ __**190.5 ÷ 28**__ − 4 = __**40**____** ÷ 9**__\n\n⇒ 6.80 − 4&l",
